{"c":[{"name":"20260829T164055Z-10a43354ce0f7523","text":"Creative: write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only; repeating membership on wake would override a consumer's gate.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T170414Z-a3069e4d545d0246","text":"Usage owns every argv it claims: note, nap ID-A ID-B CAPTION, recall, zoom, wake --path. fold_request still prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:","type":"note"}]}
